---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { boundariesText } from "./boundaries";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  b = boundariesText(lang);
---

<section data-demo="hexagonal-architecture" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{b.fiction}</p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Swap an edge, keep the application",
        "연결부를 바꿔도 애플리케이션은 그대로",
        "接点を替え、アプリケーションを保つ",
      )}
    </h2>
    <p data-fixture>{b.fixture}</p>
  </header>
  <div class="deployment" data-process>
    <p class="process-label">{b.process}</p>
    <div class="ports-map">
      <div class="edge" data-driving>
        <h3>
          {t(
            "1 · Driving adapters",
            "1 · 구동 어댑터",
            "1 · 駆動するアダプター",
          )}
        </h3>
        <ul>
          <li>HTTP</li>
          <li>CLI</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="import" data-import>
          {t("Imports → input port", "참조 → 입력 포트", "参照 → 入力ポート")}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="application" data-application>
        <h3>
          {t("2 · Application", "2 · 애플리케이션", "2 · アプリケーション")}
        </h3>
        <div class="port" data-port="input">
          <span>{t("Input port", "입력 포트", "入力ポート")}</span>
          <strong>SaveArticle</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="policy">
          {t(
            "Validate IDs, coordinate saving",
            "ID 검증 · 저장 조율",
            "IDの検証と保存の調整",
          )}
        </p>
        <div class="port" data-port="output">
          <span>
            {t(
              "Output port · owned here",
              "출력 포트 · 이곳에서 소유",
              "出力ポート · ここが所有",
            )}
          </span>
          <strong>SaveRepository</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="edge" data-driven>
        <h3>
          {t(
            "3 · Driven adapters",
            "3 · 피구동 어댑터",
            "3 · 駆動されるアダプター",
          )}
        </h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{b.memory}</li>
          <li>{b.database}</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="import" data-import>
          {t(
            "SaveRepository ← adapter imports",
            "SaveRepository ← 어댑터 참조",
            "SaveRepository ← アダプターの参照",
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="runtime" data-call>
      <h3>{b.calls}</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>HTTP / CLI</li>
        <li>SaveArticle</li>
        <li>SaveRepository</li>
        <li>
          {b.memory} / {b.database}
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Dashed path: the call reaches storage through the output port; Saved returns to the caller.",
          "파선 경로: 출력 포트로 저장소 호출, 저장 완료는 호출자에게 반환.",
          "破線の経路：出力ポート経由で保存先を呼び、保存完了を呼び出し元に返す。",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="rule" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "The application imports neither adapter implementation. Memory can stand in for the database during a test. Six sides are not six required parts.",
      "애플리케이션은 어댑터 구현을 직접 참조하지 않습니다. 테스트에서는 메모리로 데이터베이스를 대신합니다. 여섯 구성요소가 필수는 아닙니다.",
      "アプリケーションはアダプター実装を直接参照しません。テストではメモリがデータベースを代替できます。六つの構成要素は必須ではありません。",
    )}
  </p>
  <ul class="outcomes" data-outcomes>
    <li>{b.outcome}</li>
    <li>{b.failure}</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="footnote">{b.alternatives}</p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(16px, 4vw, 28px);
    background: #eef5ef;
    color: #254632;
    border: 1px solid #81988a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3,
  ol,
  ul {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #254632;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.7rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .deployment {
    border: 2px dotted #527c60;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0;
  }
  .process-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .ports-map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .ports-map > div {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .edge ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0.7rem 0;
  }
  .edge li {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #789582;
    padding: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .import {
    border-top: 2px solid #345e42;
    padding-top: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .application {
    border: 3px solid #345e42;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1rem 0.8rem;
    background: #fffdf2;
  }
  .application h3 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .port {
    border: 1px solid #789582;
    padding: 0.55rem;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .port span,
  .port strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .port strong {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .policy {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1rem 0.2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .runtime {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 2px dashed #345e42;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .runtime ol {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0;
    counter-reset: call;
  }
  .runtime li {
    counter-increment: call;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #345e42;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .runtime li::before {
    content: counter(call) " → ";
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .runtime p,
  .rule,
  .outcomes {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .rule {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .outcomes {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .outcomes li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 520px) {
    .ports-map {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .runtime ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .edge ul {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .deployment,
    .application,
    .port,
    .edge li,
    .import,
    .runtime,
    .runtime li {
      border-color: CanvasText;
    }
  }
</style>
